menu "Feldspar structured observation link"
config FELDSPAR_FEATURE_LINK
    bool "Enable feature uplink and bounded command receiver"
    default n
    help
        Requires a device-specific device_link NVS profile: device_id,
        device_key and mqtts broker_uri. Never falls back to the legacy
        service account. Sends structured DSP features, not raw recordings.
        Automatic actuation remains disabled pending physical validation.
endmenu
